<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_games",
    "Hex Jungle is a game for one player. An adventurer crosses a jungle of 255 screens, and the tunnels below it, looking for 32 treasures before twenty minutes run out. Nobody plays against you: your score is your own, and your best runs go into the ranking."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_btn_keyboard}>{dgettext("help_games", "Controls")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>
    <strong>{dgettext("help_games", "Arrow Left/Right")}</strong> {dgettext(
      "help_games",
      "— Move left and right"
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>{dgettext("help_games", "Space")}</strong> {dgettext(
      "help_games",
      "— Catch the vine in a jump"
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>{dgettext("help_games", "Arrow Up")}</strong>
    ·
    <strong>{dgettext(
      "help_games",
      "Arrow Down"
    )}</strong> {dgettext("help_games", "— Climb a ladder")}
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>{dgettext("help_games", "Arrow Down")}</strong> {dgettext(
      "help_games",
      "— Let go of the vine"
    )}
  </li>
</ul>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_rules}>{dgettext("help_games", "Rules")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>{dgettext("help_games", "You start with 2000 points, three lives and twenty minutes.")}</li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_games",
      "Each treasure is worth from 2000 to 5000 points; once taken, it stays taken."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_games",
      "Touching a rolling tree trunk costs points. Falling down a hole costs 100 points."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_games",
      "A pit, quicksand, a crocodile's jaws, fire, a snake or a scorpion costs a life."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_games",
      "Each screen of the tunnel is three of the jungle's: a shortcut, when no wall blocks it."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_games",
      "The game ends when the twenty minutes are over, when the last life is lost, or when the 32nd treasure is found. The End button keeps the points you have."
    )}
  </li>
</ul>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_joystick}>{dgettext("help_games", "Inspiration")}</.help_h4>
<p>{dgettext("help_games", "Inspired by Activision's Pitfall! (1982) for the Atari 2600.")}</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_games", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <.help_link topic="feature-retro-games">{dgettext("help_games", "Retro Games")}</.help_link>
</p>
